{"2133620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Battle of Decay: Survival", "steam_appid": 2133620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle of Decay: Survival</strong> is a casual, arcade‑leaning top‑down wave survival set during the outbreak. Play solo or 1-4 player co‑op, unlock sections, gear up, and hold the line against the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/1596d4bfd386ef9c8c565db514baf5a2.poster.avif?t=1755528408\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/1596d4bfd386ef9c8c565db514baf5a2.webm?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/1596d4bfd386ef9c8c565db514baf5a2.mp4?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wave onslaught with optional head‑locking auto‑aim laser</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why BoD:S?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy top‑down gunplay, clear progression through sections, perks, and upgradeable weapons - all at an arcade pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/98b854019f658bc80598b3be16da0059.poster.avif?t=1755528408\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/98b854019f658bc80598b3be16da0059.webm?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/98b854019f658bc80598b3be16da0059.mp4?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use defensive objects and turrets to hold the position as long as you can</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story (Co‑op):</strong> Fight through a hospital, underground areas, and the city. Unlock new sections, find codes, and survive the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Survival (Co‑op or Bots):</strong> Arena‑style maps with purchasable sections, mystery/merch boxes, escalating waves, placeable defenses, upgrades, and leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mods/Workshop:</strong> Early Steam Workshop support for community maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/ccf2470712ab1140d6426c2ec0768bd6.poster.avif?t=1755528408\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/ccf2470712ab1140d6426c2ec0768bd6.webm?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/ccf2470712ab1140d6426c2ec0768bd6.mp4?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Open doors, find code notes, and complete quick wiring/code minigames to expand the map</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infected Variants:</strong> Regulars, sprinters, tanks, plus huggers (grabs) and spitters (vision block) with quick counter prompts - with mini‑boss encounters off‑wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sections &amp; Economy:</strong> Earn points from kills and repairs to buy ammo, open doors, unlock areas, and roll mystery/merch boxes. Gain XP to unlock more guns and features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Weapons &amp; Perks:</strong> Power up damage, mag size, fire rate, and more; pick perks like more health, faster reloads, or an extra weapon slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout, Gear &amp; Placeables:</strong> Bring a primary weapon and equipment (grenades, molotov, stun, decoys). Fortify with mobile barricades, auto‑turrets, ammo boxes, and med kits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vests &amp; Teamplay:</strong> Vests boost survivability and team utility (e.g., faster revives).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Style &amp; Competition:</strong> Leaderboards and a cosmetics shop (skins, laser colors, light‑up shoes, ammo/effect colors).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/debc62a14920ff54c9787b8b2e75c9ac.poster.avif?t=1755528408\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/debc62a14920ff54c9787b8b2e75c9ac.webm?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/debc62a14920ff54c9787b8b2e75c9ac.mp4?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Upgrade weapons and pick perks to fit your playstyle</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re actively expanding BoD:S: more maps (hospital, bunker, subway, city), new enemy mixes, QoL, and deeper mod support. Your feedback directly shapes development - share your suggestions anytime :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/500dc87298ddf391086b9a9a1e9a6467.poster.avif?t=1755528408\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/500dc87298ddf391086b9a9a1e9a6467.webm?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/500dc87298ddf391086b9a9a1e9a6467.mp4?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Huggers and spitters - counter quickly or get overwhelmed</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist &amp; Feedback</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add BoD:S to your wishlist</strong> and tell us what to improve - help us refine the outbreak experience!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle of Decay: Survival</strong> is a casual, arcade‑leaning top‑down wave survival set during the outbreak. Play solo or 1-4 player co‑op, unlock sections, gear up, and hold the line against the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/1596d4bfd386ef9c8c565db514baf5a2.poster.avif?t=1755528408\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/1596d4bfd386ef9c8c565db514baf5a2.webm?t=1755528408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133620/extras/1596d4bfd386ef9c8c565db514baf5